--- stderr ---
error: roles match-shaper: load handoff: handoff source "absent.json" is not accessible: lstat <ROOT>/absent.json: no such file or directory


== goal missing
$ roles match-shaper --root <ROOT> --handoff handoff.json
exit: 0
